 - Player: join form `Your name` label+placeholder + Join; `Hi, name!` waiting; open `button.play-option` + `Your answer` mark, upsert last pick; closed `Correct!/Wrong!/No answer` via server `result_text/class` (JS has no Correct/Wrong strings, JSON omits `is_correct` before closed, page source clean); finished `The quiz is over`; remember via `quizzy_CODE` cookie + `localStorage quizzy_player_CODE`, state checks cookie/query/header; can join lobby/open/closed, not finished
