+
+## Prizes / Scoring / Winners (2026-10-07)
+- Schema: `quizzes.num_winners INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 3`, `games.question_opened_at INTEGER (ms)`, `answers.answered_at/elapsed_ms INTEGER (ms)`, `game_winners(game_id,player_id PK)`; `init_db` creates fresh + migrates old via `PRAGMA table_info` + `ALTER TABLE`, backfills `num_winners=3` where NULL/<1, no new crates so offline build unchanged
+- Settings: `GET /moderate/quizzes/{id}/settings` adds `<label for="num_winners">Number of winners</label><input type=number min=1 required>` with current value (3 default); `POST /moderate/quizzes/{id}` validates title + `num_winners>=1` (supports `num_winners|number_of_winners|winners`), errors `Title can't be blank` / `Number of winners must be at least 1` re-rendered via `render_settings_form` preserving input, no DB write on fail; `POST /moderate/quizzes` (new) defaults 3, validates if field present
+- Timing: `now_ms()` = `SystemTime::now` millis; `do_start/do_next` set `question_opened_at=now_ms()` (fallback if column missing); `POST /play/{code}/answer` computes `elapsed=max(0,now-opened)` (0 if NULL) and upserts `answered_at/elapsed_ms` so last pick wins; per-request connections with WAL+busy_timeout handle concurrency
+- Scoring: `compute_scores(game)` = per player `COUNT correct` + `SUM(elapsed)` for correct only (`JOIN options is_correct=1`, NULL→0), sorted `points desc, total_time asc, name.lower asc, id asc`, place=index+1; `points_text` = `1 point` vs `N points`; `PlayState` omits `place/points/*` (`skip_serializing_if None`) before finished so phones see no points during game, `ModGameState.leaderboard` empty before finished
+- Live speed: polling `POLL_MS 250ms` (was 500ms) for both `big_screen.js`/`play.js`, small JSON, ignore fetch errors; server `opened_at` ensures fairness, all clients see question within ~250ms of moderator POST (which also `fetchState()` immediately)
+- Finished big screen: `build_mod_state` for `finished` builds `leaderboard: Vec<LeaderEntry{place,player_id,name,points,points_text,total_time_ms,is_winner}>` + `winners: Vec<id>` + `num_winners`; `render_big_screen_inner` shows `The quiz is over` + `<ol class=leaderboard id=leaderboard><li class="leader[ is-winner]"><span leader__place>1</span><span leader__name>Alice</span><span leader__score>2 points</span>[<span mark--winner>Winner</span>]` in order + controls `<button id=btn-top>Top N</button><button id=btn-draw>Draw</button><button id=btn-reset>Reset winners</button>`; JS `render(finished)` uses `JSON.stringify` sig to avoid flicker/button loss, re-binds `POST .../top|draw|reset-winners`
+- Finished phones: `build_play_state` for `finished+joined` finds player in `compute_scores` → `place/total_players/place_text="Place X of Y"/points/points_text/is_winner`; `render_player_inner` shows `The quiz is over` + `<div id=place>Place X of Y</div><div id=points>N points</div>` + `<div id=won class=winner-banner>You won!` if winner; JS `render(finished)` change-detects `place_text/points_text/is_winner` for live winners without flicker; not-joined after finished sees only `The quiz is over`
+- Winners routes: `POST /moderate/games/{code}/top|draw|reset-winners` (+ aliases `/winners/top|draw|reset`) behind Basic middleware, only when `finished`, else return state; `set_winners` = `DELETE+INSERT OR IGNORE`; JSON response = fresh `ModGameState`, HTML fallback = redirect to big screen
+- Winners logic: `compute_top_winner_ids` = first N of leaderboard filtered `points>0`; `compute_draw_winner_ids` = if `scored<=N` all scored, else `cutoff=scores[N-1].points` (>0), `winners=points>cutoff`, `remaining=N-winners.len()`, `candidates=points==cutoff` shuffled via `random_shuffle` (Fisher-Yates with `game_random_bytes`) truncated to `remaining`; zeros never win, speed ignored for Draw, each Draw re-shuffles; `N=quiz_num_winners()` (max(1,3 default))
+- QA labels: exact visible `Number of winners`, `Top 3`, `Draw`, `Reset winners`, `Winner`, `You won!`, `2 points/1 point/0 points`, `Place 2 of 5`, `End quiz`; leaderboard `ol>li` each with place+name+points, phones `Place`+`points` live via polling
